1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
The President's Cake is a drama film directed by Hasan Hadi.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
In 1990s Iraq, it's 'draw day', when schools select students for the honour of bringing items
to their mandatory local celebrations of President Saddam Hussein's birthday.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Nine-year-old Lamia lives in the historic marshes
with her spirited grandmother, Bibi.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Before school, Bibi teaches Lamia clever tricks to
avoid being chosen for the baking duties.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
However, when Musa, the authoritative teacher, calls Lamia's name for the most
challenging task–the birthday cake–she has no choice but to accept.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Refusing could mean imprisonment or even death.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Lamia, played by Banin Ahmad Nayef.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Saeed, played by Sajad Mohamad Qasem.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Bibi, played by Waheed Thabet Khreibat.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Jasim, played by Rahim AlHaj.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Muthanna, played by Muthanna Malaghi.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Musa, played by Ahmad Qasem Saywan.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
The President's Cake (Arabic: مملكة القصب) is a 2025 drama
film written and directed by Hasan Hadi.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
It stars Baneen Ahmad Nayyef, Sajad Mohamad Qasem,
Waheed Thabet Khreibat and Rahim AlHaj.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film had its world premiere at the Directors' Fortnight section of the 2025 Cannes Film
Festival on May 16, 2025, where it won the section's Audience Award and the Caméra d'Or.

16
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It was selected as the Iraqi entry for Best International Feature Film at
the 98th Academy Awards, making the December shortlist.

17
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
It is scheduled to be released in the United States by
Sony Pictures Classics on February 6, 2026.

18
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
The film explores themes of dictatorship, birthday cake,
police arrest, counterfeit money, 1990s.

19
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
The tone is emotional.
